      "code": "13A",
      "title": "Differential equations",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "abbotsleigh2020-ext1-q13bi",
          "type": "review",
          "difficulty": "medium",
          "stem": "Soup cools according to \\(\\frac{dT}{dt}=-k(T-21)\\), where k is positive. Initially \\(T(0)=96^circ C\\). Show that \\(T=21+75e^{-kt}\\) is a solution.",
          "manual": true,
          "answer": "Sample answer: Differentiating gives \\(dT/dt=-75ke^{-kt}\\). Also \\(-k(T-21)=-k(75e^{-kt})=-75ke^{-kt}\\), so the proposed function satisfies the differential equation. At t=0, \\(T=21+75=96\\), so it also satisfies the initial condition.",
          "hint": "Differentiate the proposed temperature function and separately substitute it into the right side of the differential equation.",
          "keyPoints": [
            {
              "text": "\\(T=21+75e^{-kt}\\)",
              "note": "Differentiate the exponential term using the chain rule."
            },
            {
              "text": "\\(T(0)=96^circ C\\)",
              "note": "Check the initial condition after checking the differential equation."
            }
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "explain": "Differentiate the proposed solution with respect to time.",
              "work": "\\(\\frac{dT}{dt}=75(-k)e^{-kt}=-75ke^{-kt}\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Substitute the proposed solution into the right side of the differential equation.",
              "work": "\\(-k(T-21)=-k(21+75e^{-kt}-21)=-75ke^{-kt}\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Both sides agree, and the initial value is correct.",
              "work": "\\(T(0)=21+75=96\\Rightarrow T=21+75e^{-kt}\\text{ is a solution}\\)"
            }
          ],
          "solution": "Sample answer: Differentiating gives \\(dT/dt=-75ke^{-kt}\\). Also \\(-k(T-21)=-k(75e^{-kt})=-75ke^{-kt}\\), so the proposed function satisfies the differential equation. At t=0, \\(T=21+75=96\\), so it also satisfies the initial condition.",
          "timeLimit": 60,
          "xp": 1,
          "meta": {
